<title>HONG KONG: Lippo Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Lippo Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger LTCB Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  PT LIPPO BANK, ACTING THROUGH ITS COOK ISLANDS BRANCH  AMOUNT    US$50 MLN   COUPON     6ML+80     MATURITY  4 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH    10.JAN.96</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 2	  CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES   29.JAN.96</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p>RATING NONE SALE LMTS STANDARD TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY INDONESIA   GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE  EARLY MAR</p>
<p>MANAGEMENT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS  US$4-5 MLN  42 BP  ALL-IN 101 BP</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGRS    US$2-3 MLN  38 BP  ALL-IN  99 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS ARAB BANKING CORP SINGAPORE, BNP SINGAPORE, LTCB ASIA</p>
<p>	     AND TOKAI ASIA.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
